                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Insight:</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> Settlement shifts away from water-favored and intensively irrigated locations.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Why it matters:</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'> This may reflect changing priorities in site selection, with greater weight placed on topography, control, or defensibility rather than immediate agricultural advantage.ed</run>
